  "ranking": "Same normalized7day momentum rank as the24h control. For the gated arm, before ranking require side equal sign(BTC return from known closed H1 at signal boundary versus7days earlier). BTC zero => cash. No alternative lookback or gate threshold.",
  "execution": "One full H1 delay after UTC daily signal. Initial stop distance is min(2ATR14 daily,5%of signal close); recheck actual fill against1.5liquidation buffer. Exit at market, adverse rounded spread/slippage. Same2%wallet risk. Control closes after24h, candidate after168h at most. Full re-simulation and funding reserve depend on holding horizon.",
  "turnover_and_funding": "Turnover proxy from preceding24 completed H1 volumes * contract size * close. Realized funding settlement strictly after entry; uncertain intrahour credits omitted if an exit can occur. Conservative Fair liquidation priority. Last proxy explicitly fails final approval.",
  "screen": "Retain the prior consistency requirement: positive base and stress results in all three planned periods and their temporal sub-blocks, <=10%DD in each base period, plus positive continuous base/stress. Never approve production from this retrospective evaluation. The continuous calculation is an additional accounting view, not another strategy trial.",
  "no_search": "One BTC7day directional gate only. Replay exact24h control from prior trial. Same costs,size/risk,stop cap,delay,and24h holding. No direction-specific or symbol-specific pruning. All negative runs remain reported.",
